iddle\" width=\"146\" height=\"81\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"44\" height=\"81\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"left\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 응시자격&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 국가공무원법 제33조(결격사유) 각호의 결격사유에 해당되지 아니한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 응시연령 : 18세 이상인자(1991년 1월 1일 이전 출생)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 학력 및 경력 : 이공학계열 석사학위 이상 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 국책사업 수행 경력자 우대</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">3. 계약기간 및 보수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 계약기간 : 1년 단위로 사업종료일(2014.05.31) 까지 계약 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 보수수준 : 연봉 18,000천원 정도(명절휴가비,성과상여금등 제수당 포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 보수수준은 성과평가등급 등에 따라 다소 변동될 수 있음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 근무조건 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">4대 보험 가입, 1년 이상 근무시 퇴직금 지급, 기타 복리후생 적용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>※ 기타사항은 첨부파일을 참고하시기 바랍니다.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
